{"id":"1d8eda9b-0fe1-80e4-966f-cf0065e3251f","title":"data-color","parentId":"1d4eda9b-0fe1-80a2-95f7-e975482b1dcd","category":"리액트","categoryId":"source:리액트","createdAt":"2025-04-17T08:31:48.227Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-18T05:19:30.716Z","markdown":"<a id=\"1d8eda9b0fe18069b973fb5ed52a44e7\"></a>\n\n## <code>data&#45;color</code>\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"1d8eda9b0fe180d398cdc20e614c3897\"></a>\n\n변수명으로 색상 지정 가능하다&#46; \n\n<a id=\"1d8eda9b0fe1805bb62de4a2086f3de9\"></a>\n\n```css\n.con3 .listBox li .img { background-color: var(--sub-color); border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 30% 0; }\n\n . . .\n\n.con3 .listBox li[data-color=\"a\"]{--sub-color: #d1dbfd;}\n.con3 .listBox li[data-color=\"b\"]{--sub-color: #90c3cd;}\n.con3 .listBox li[data-color=\"c\"]{--sub-color: #ff764a;}\n.con3 .listBox li[data-color=\"d\"]{--sub-color: #47b172;}\n.con3 .listBox li[data-color=\"e\"]{--sub-color: #ffb84f;}\n```\n\n- 위와 같이 <strong><u>클래스명을 지정</u></strong>하여  해당 DOM에 색상을 지정할 수 있다&#46; \n\n<details>\n<summary>html &#45; 각 클래스(css)  지정</summary>\n\n<a id=\"1d8eda9b0fe180a7a467c765b612fd74\"></a>\n\n```css\n<ul class=\"listBox\">\n  <li data-color=\"a\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"b\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"c\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"d\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"e\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"a\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"b\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"c\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n  <li data-color=\"d\">\n    <p class=\"img\"><img src=\"images/projects.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n    <h4>\n      <span class=\"a\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"b\">2025</span>\n    </h4>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n</details>\n","path":"posts/1d8eda9b-0fe1-80e4-966f-cf0065e3251f/data-color.md","url":"https://beautiful-college-c84.notion.site/1d8eda9b0fe180e4966fcf0065e3251f","excerpt":"data&45;color --- 변수명으로 색상 지정 가능하다&46; css .con3 .listBox li .img { background-color: var(--sub-color); border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 30% 0; } . . . .con3 .list","cover":null,"icon":null,"order":48,"revision":"dc2b090fb4996696f6ec4799889c1afd45eb64762732b0550a70c68228520c19","bodyLoaded":true}